.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH find 1  "find " 
.SH NAME
find \- Fuzzy\-find snippets by name (local library + cached cloud names), ranked
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfind\fR [\fB\-\-plain\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fuzzy\-find snippets by name (local library + cached cloud names), ranked
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-plain\fR
Print bare names only, one per line (for piping into tools like fzf)
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 10]
Maximum number of matches to print
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
Fuzzy query (characters in order, not necessarily adjacent)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg find dep
  fg find dep \-\-plain
